      "paperId": "9d716cc42e58b662b948000242f42a50dc98761f",
      "title": "Vittorio H\u00f6sle on the Systematicity and Historicity of Modern Philosophy: An Attempt of a Paradigmatic Analysis of Kant's Philosophy of History",
      "authors": [
